IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sssa-nouns`
IMPORT `sssa-part3-administration`
IMPORT `sssa-part4-miscellaneous`

-- Tests for sssa-part4-miscellaneous.l4 (ss 11 to 20).  Every expected value is
-- written from the text of the provision, beside the assertion, before the run.
-- Amounts, days and counts that the facts would supply are stand-ins invented
-- for the test; the Act gives none of them except the ceilings it states.

§ `Tests -- Part 4`


§§ `s 11(1) obtaining a benefit by false statements`
-- inputs: false statement made knowingly or recklessly, false document, dishonestly obtains the benefit with the intention described
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the person is guilty of an offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the person is guilty of an offence` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the person is guilty of an offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the person is guilty of an offence` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the person is guilty of an offence` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the person is guilty of an offence` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the person is guilty of an offence` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- fields:                                greatest fine in dollars, greatest imprisonment in months
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the greatest penalty` EQUALS Penalty OF 5000, 12
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the sentence is within the greatest penalty` 5000 12 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the sentence is within the greatest penalty` 5000 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the sentence is within the greatest penalty` 5001 12 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 11(1) the sentence is within the greatest penalty` 5000 13 EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 11(2) the right of recovery is unaffected`
#ASSERT `s 11(2) the right of recovery under section 10 is unaffected by section 11(1)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 11(2) the right of recovery under section 10 is unaffected by section 11(1)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 11(2) the right of recovery under section 10 is unaffected by section 11(1)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 11(2) the right of recovery under section 10 is unaffected by section 11(1)` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 12 the court's order on conviction`
-- inputs: has received a cash grant or other benefit, convicted of an offence under the Act in connection with it
#ASSERT `s 12 the court may order the person to pay the certified amount to an administrator` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 12 the court may order the person to pay the certified amount to an administrator` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 12 the court may order the person to pay the certified amount to an administrator` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 12 the court may order the person to pay the certified amount to an administrator` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the amount: the amount certified by the administrator as at the date of the conviction (300 is a stand-in)
#ASSERT `s 12 the amount the court may order the person to pay` TRUE TRUE (JUST 300) EQUALS JUST 300
#ASSERT `s 12 the amount the court may order the person to pay` TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 12 the amount the court may order the person to pay` TRUE FALSE (JUST 300) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 12 the amount the court may order the person to pay` FALSE TRUE (JUST 300) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 13 the certificate`
-- inputs: purports to be issued by an administrator, certifies the amount received, certifies the amount recoverable
#ASSERT `s 13 the certificate is prima facie evidence of the amount stated` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 13 the certificate is prima facie evidence of the amount stated` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 13 the certificate is prima facie evidence of the amount stated` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 13 the certificate is prima facie evidence of the amount stated` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 13 the certificate is prima facie evidence of the amount stated` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 13 the certificate is prima facie evidence of the amount stated` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 13 the certificate is prima facie evidence of the amount stated` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

